<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 278)</h2>
<p><b>When you compare, the web sees it.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Compare now travels to every peer live — wipe position, mode changes and B selection reach native guests and web reviewers as you work, not just when someone joins.</li>
<li>Web reviewers see your comparison: wipe (with the exact same split line), show-B, side-by-side, mix and add — with a badge naming the mode and the B clip. Difference view stays app-only for now, and the page says so honestly.</li>
<li>The B stream rides the playlist share: comparing against a clip that's in the share plays it on the web frame-locked to A, including the sync offset.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
